      </p>

      <h2>3. Eligibility</h2>
      <p>
        You must be at least 18 years of age and represent a valid corporate entity to submit contact inquiries, budget estimations, or request assessments through our website forms.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Acceptable Use Policy</h2>
      <p>
        You agree to use our website only for lawful purposes. You are strictly prohibited from:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Deploying web scrapers, spiders, indexers, or automated tools to extract site content, contact databases, or blog articles.</li>
        <li>Submitting fraudulent, false, or misleading data via our contact forms.</li>
        <li>Impersonating another person or business entity during consultations or form submissions.</li>
        <li>Injecting scripts, malware, or attempting to compromise the security and performance of our web servers.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        All content on this website, including text copy, code scripts, SVG icons, logos, graphic layouts, and typography, is the intellectual property of Raynetic Solutions Pty Ltd and is protected by copyright and trademark laws. You may not copy, republish, or use our brand components for external commercial purposes without our prior written consent.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Website Availability & Disclaimers</h2>
      <p>
        This website and all resource contents are provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. While we strive to maintain high security and accessibility, we do <strong>NOT</strong> guarantee that our marketing website will be online, error-free, or secure at all times. We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or restrict access to any page without prior notice.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Australian Consumer Law (ACL) Protections</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing in these Terms excludes, restricts, or modifies any consumer guarantees, rights, or remedies you are entitled to under the <strong>Competition and Consumer Act 2010 (Cth)</strong> and the <strong>Australian Consumer Law (ACL)</strong> that cannot be legally excluded. If you engage us as a consumer, our services come with guarantees that cannot be excluded under the ACL, including that services will be provided with due care and skill.
