      </p>

      <h2>13. Severability</h2>
      <p>
        If any clause of these Terms is found to be invalid or unenforceable by a court of competent jurisdiction, that clause will be severed, and the remaining provisions of these Terms will continue in full force and effect.
      </p>

      <h2>14. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        For questions or legal requests regarding these Terms of Service, please contact us at:
      </p>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs p-4 bg-white/5 border border-border rounded-xl">
        Legal Counsel Department<br />
